From faabc89e707d5bf7caaa55f9bcfbe4fb56da4825 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 15:14:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Campus notifications with {actor}, Expo push receipts, loud
 TEST_DATABASE_URL

- POST /internal/v1/notifications accepts campus-service kinds with caller-written
  title/body; {actor} is filled with the display name, or actor_fallback when the
  actor is unknown or the two are blocked either way (actor ids dropped from data).
  The response carries Social's notification_id (the same id on a retry).
- Expo ticket ids are stored (push_tickets, migration 0008); receipts are read
  ~15 min later every 5 min and on POST /internal/v1/tasks/push-receipts; failures
  are logged with the reason and DeviceNotRegistered tokens disabled.
- The test suite stops when only TEST_DATABASE_URL is set instead of running SQLite.
- README: the ambassador admin row read 'dmin' (a stray BEL character).
